# Dev-only ground truth. The API never loads these and _strip_truth guards
# every response, but there is no reason to ship the answer key inside the
# image where `docker exec` would reveal it. The smoke test reads truth.json
# from the local checkout (--repo-root), not from the container, and falls
# back to structural checks when it is absent — so excluding this costs
# nothing operationally.
data/cases/*/truth.json
